{"id":"2ad47b40eb6f54c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-top-baire-space-property.md","title":"ZFC Top Baire Space Property","display":"df-zfc-top-baire-space-property — ZFC Top Baire Space Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-baire-space-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-baire-space-property"],"display":"df-zfc-top-baire-space-property — ZFC Top Baire Space Property","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-baire-space-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-baire-space-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-baire-space-property — ZFC Top Baire Space Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>（拓扑空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\)</span>（开集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\)</span>（稠密集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-序列谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence\">58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopBaireSpaceProperty}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopBaireSpaceProperty}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}baire\\text{-}space\\text{-}property}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopBaireSpaceProperty}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(f,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,f(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,f(n))\\bigr)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\bigl(X,\\tau,\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}baire\\text{-}space\\text{-}property}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopBaireSpaceProperty}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(f,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,f(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,f(n))\\bigr)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\bigl(X,\\tau,\\bigcap\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Baire 性要求每个可数开稠密集族的交仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中稠密。</li>\n<li>显式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-序列谓词保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是函数，而不仅是一个具有形式域记号的关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$（拓扑空间谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S$（开集谓词，见 [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top5-open-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S$（稠密集谓词，见 [[58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S$（$\\omega$-序列谓词，见 [[58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S","display":false